<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29878" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐᾱτέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be suffered</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1210
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐατέος ἐστὶ φεύγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.108
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				401b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐατέον</span>
			<i>one must suffer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				173
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be let alone</i> or <i>given up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὁ πλοῦτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					905
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.564
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν ἐατέον τῆς
			κατοικίσεως</span> we <i>must let</i> it <i>alone</i> as to
			foundation, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				969c
			</span></i>; <i>one must dismiss</i> from one's mind, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				512e
			</span></i>; <i>one must omit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.5.18
			</span></i>.</div>
